   "char_end": 86,
   "audio_start_s": 4.88,
   "audio_end_s": 6.96,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "And sixty cents of it was in pennies."
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 87,
   "char_end": 284,
   "audio_start_s": 7.81,
   "audio_end_s": 20.18,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "Pennies saved one and two at a time by bulldozing the grocer and the vegetable man and the butcher until one’s cheeks burned with the silent imputation of parsimony that such close dealing implied."
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 285,
   "char_end": 314,
   "audio_start_s": 20.98,
   "audio_end_s": 22.68,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "Three times Della counted it."
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 315,
   "char_end": 349,
   "audio_start_s": 23.28,
   "audio_end_s": 25.61,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "One dollar and eighty-seven cents."
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 350,
   "char_end": 386,
   "audio_start_s": 26.33,
   "audio_end_s": 28.13,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "And the next day would be Christmas."
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 387,
   "char_end": 469,
   "audio_start_s": 28.95,
   "audio_end_s": 33.34,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "There was clearly nothing to do but flop down on the shabby little couch and howl."
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 470,
   "char_end": 486,
   "audio_start_s": 33.93,
   "audio_end_s": 34.9,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "So Della did it."
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 487,
   "char_end": 605,
   "audio_start_s": 35.89,
   "audio_end_s": 43.72,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "Which instigates the moral reflection that life is made up of sobs, sniffles, and smiles, with sniffles predominating."
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "spine_index": 2,
   "char_start": 606,
   "char_end": 720,
   "audio_start_s": 44.48,
   "audio_end_s": 50.57,
   "matched": true,
   "text": "While the mistress of the home is gradually subsiding from the first stage to the second, take a look at the home."
